╭─ Patch Generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Reasoning: The issue raised is that the extra_body field, which is │
│ used in model metadata to include additional request body          │
│ parameters for providers like openrouter in litellm, is not        │
│ supported in the send_completion function in aider/sendchat.py.    │
│ This causes any extra_body settings from the model metadata to not │
