│ The main place where the openrouter provider's extra_body field    │
│ can be supported is in the send_completion function, which         │
│ prepares and sends the request to litellm. Adding an extra_body    │
│ parameter to send_completion and including it in kwargs passed to  │
│ litellm.completion allows Aider to forward any extra_body data     │
│ from the model metadata or caller.                                 │
│                                                                    │
│ For the model metadata loading (register_litellm_models), this     │
│ patch leaves the existing code intact but adds a comment for       │
│ clarity, since the external models.register_litellm_models likely  │
│ handles loading JSON metadata including any extra_body fields. The │
│ key is to ensure send_completion supports passing extra_body.      │
│                                                                    │
│ This minimal patch adds the necessary support to send_completion   │
│ while preserving all existing functionality.                       │
